<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_action_switch_php_param">ActionSwitchPhpParam</link></para>

<para>This class handles the switching of PHP parameters on and off. It modifies the PHP configuration file based on the provided arguments. </para>
